This app implements the todo.txt format specification by Gina Trapani
(https://github.com/todotxt/todo.txt), which is published under the
GNU General Public License v3. The specification is a data format, not
code; no todo.txt project source is incorporated here.

The frontend bundles third-party npm dependencies (CodeMirror 6 and
others) at build time. Their licenses are declared in ui/package.json
and reproduced in each package's own distribution.
